## Stack

Next.js 16 (App Router) · Tailwind v4 · shadcn/ui · TypeScript · Vitest + RTL (minimal snapshots)

**No backend** — all content is static in `src/content/`. No GraphQL, RTK Query, or CMS unless explicitly requested.

## Key files

| Purpose | Location |
|---------|----------|
| Site-wide copy | `src/content/site.ts` |
| Projects list | `src/content/projects.ts` |
| Types | `src/content/types.ts` |
| Theme / cyberpunk palette | `src/app/globals.css` |
| Project images | `public/projects/` |

## Routes

- `/` — single-page home (Hero, About, Projects, Contact)
- `/projects/[slug]` — project detail
- `/projects/[slug]/privacy` · `/projects/[slug]/terms` — per-app legal pages
- `/privacy` — site-wide privacy policy

Current projects: **flowbit**, **no-wez-zgadnij**

## Design

Subtle **cyberpunk** — dark theme, cyan/magenta accents, readable Geist fonts. Avoid performance-heavy CSS: no `background-attachment: fixed`, no full-screen overlays, no `backdrop-blur`, no animated box-shadows on scroll.

## Conventions

- Edit content in `src/content/`, not hardcoded in components
- New projects: add to `projects.ts` → routes auto-generate via `generateStaticParams`
- Keep diffs minimal; match existing component/style patterns
- Run `npm run build` and `npm run test` after substantive changes
- Do not commit unless asked

## Next.js note

This repo uses Next.js 16 with breaking changes vs older versions. Check `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` if unsure about APIs.
